# dinosaur-pos — domain context (tóm tắt)

**Full doc:** [docs/CONTEXT.md](mdc:docs/CONTEXT.md) — cập nhật khi thêm module lớn.

## Stack nhanh

- Go `POS-kasir`, Fiber, sqlc/PostgreSQL, migrations `sqlc/migrations/` → `make migrate-up` on deploy.
- React 19 in `web/`, TanStack Router + Query, i18n vi/en/id, RBAC `web/src/lib/auth/rbacRules.ts`.

## Stock receipts

- **List** `_dashboard.stock-receipts.tsx`; **create** full page `/stock-receipts/new` (POS-style + `StockReceiptCheckoutPanel`); **edit/view** modal `StockReceiptEditorDialog` only.
- Payment: DB columns `payment_mode` (`cash`|`credit`), `amount_paid` (migration 027). Legacy `note` + `__payment__` JSON via `web/src/lib/stock-receipts/paymentNote.ts` — display only for old rows, no backfill.
- **Complete** receipt: if balance > 0 → one `supplier_debts` row (`supplierdebts.CreateDebtFromStockReceiptTx`).

## Debt ledgers MVP (v1)

- Packages: `internal/supplierdebts`, `internal/customerdebts`; routes `/supplier-debts`, `/customer-debts` (manager+).
- FE: `_dashboard.supplier-debts.tsx`, `_dashboard.customer-debts.tsx`, queries `supplierDebts.ts` / `customerDebts.ts`, shared sheet `components/debts/PartnerDebtDetailSheet.tsx`.
- Status: `open|partial|settled|void`; partial payments + manual entries + void; summary endpoints per partner.
- **Orders:** create unpaid + customer → `customer_debts`; cancel → void debt; Transactions full pay → `RecordOrderPaymentTx` (avoid duplicate with debt-module pay).
- **Out of scope v1:** aging, credit limits, accounting/cash drawer sync, backfill old receipt notes.

## Conventions when changing this area

- Add RBAC rules for new API paths; wire `server/routes.go` + `server/server.go`.
- Mirror patterns between supplier/customer debt packages when reasonable.
- Minimize scope; match existing stockreceipts/suppliers style; i18n all three locales.
